=== T-919: C-001 measures preservation, not location ===

NEGATIVE — an inception with no preserved thinking must STILL warn
  PASS  template-only sections + long outcome prose -> WARNS
  PASS  a FILLED-IN template hypothesis (~320 chars, T-184's real shape) -> WARNS

POSITIVE — an inception whose reasoning IS in its task file goes silent
  PASS  a real 500-char Hypothesis and nothing else -> SILENT (T-879's shape)
  PASS  Problem Statement + Open Questions -> SILENT (T-250's shape, sized like it)

CONTROLS
  PASS  filled template scores below the threshold (242 < 400)
  PASS  real prose scores above it (803 >= 400)
  PASS  completed scan IMPORTS the predicate
  PASS  active scan IMPORTS the predicate
  PASS  neither scanner carries its own RESEARCH_SECTIONS list
  PASS  in-task record skips the unreferenced branch (a task cannot fail to cite itself)

